---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="Hyunuk Kim - Assistant Professor at Elon University">
  <div class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="profile-image">
        <img src="/files/profile.png" alt="Hyunuk Kim" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Hyunuk Kim, Ph.D.</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Assistant Professor of Business Analytics & Director of the Center for Applied Analytics and AI</p>
        <p class="institution">Elon University</p>
        
        <div class="bio">
          <p>I am an Assistant Professor of Business Analytics and the director of the Center for Applied Analytics and AI at Elon University. My research aims to understand how individuals process information and collectively shape sociotechnical systems. I use network science, natural language processing, and machine learning methods to identify latent factors of knowledge creation, cultural evolution, and misinformation spread on social media.</p>
          
          <p>I was an Assistant Professor at Boston University Metropolitan College and a Postdoctoral Associate at Boston University Questrom School of Business (affiliated with the Institute for Health System Innovation & Policy / Advisor: Prof. Dylan Walker). In graduate studies, I was under the mentorship of Prof. Woo-Sung Jung and Prof. Hyejin Youn.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-info">
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hkim6@elon.edu">hkim6@elon.edu</a></p>
          <p><strong>Office:</strong> Elon University, Elon, NC</p>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-links">
          <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=HNotJa0AAAAJ" target="_blank" class="link-button">Google Scholar</a>
          <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4863-4729" target="_blank" class="link-button">ORCID</a>
          <a href="/cv" class="link-button">Curriculum Vitae</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="highlights-section">
    <h2>Research Highlights</h2>
    <div class="highlights-grid">
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h3>📊 Network Science</h3>
        <p>Analyzing complex networks and information flow in sociotechnical systems using graph theory and statistical methods.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h3>🔤 NLP & ML</h3>
        <p>Applying natural language processing and machine learning to understand knowledge creation and information spread.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h3>🌐 Social Media</h3>
        <p>Studying cultural evolution and misinformation dynamics across online platforms and social networks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h3>📈 Analytics</h3>
        <p>Developing applied analytics solutions and directing AI research initiatives at the Center for Applied Analytics and AI.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .hero-section {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .hero-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .profile-image {
      position: sticky;
      top: 100px;
    }

    .profile-image img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .hero-text h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .institution {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .bio {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .bio p {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .contact-info {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact-info p {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .quick-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .link-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background-color: var(--color-accent);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .link-button:hover {
      background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .highlights-section {
      margin-top: 4rem;
      padding-top: 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .highlights-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .highlights-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .highlight-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .highlight-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
    }

    .highlight-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .highlight-card p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .profile-image {
        position: static;
      }

      .hero-text h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .highlights-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .quick-links {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .link-button {
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Page>
